# Lets the command center re-plug the top camera's USB port in software (Studio "Repair top camera"), nothing else.
# Exactly one command, with no arguments (the "" means: no arguments allowed).
# Install: see deploy/README.md step 6b. YOUR_USER is filled in by the install command.
YOUR_USER ALL=(root) NOPASSWD: /usr/local/sbin/kiro-gemini-rebind ""
